<title>ZIMBABWE: SOCCER-ZIMBABWE AND GHANA DRAW 0-0 IN NATIONS CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ZIMBABWE AND GHANA DRAW 0-0 IN NATIONS CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1997-01-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe and Ghana drew 0-0 in an</p>
<p>African Nations Cup group one qualifying match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Attendance: 45,000</p>
</text>
